    "enUS": {
      "description": "It seems as though poor Ol' Rustlocke ran into a Dark Iron ambush.  You notice a parchment next to his clenched fist.\n\nReport the grim news to Rhag Garmason and show him what you found.",
      "dialogue": {
        "ada5d8ccb252c4ee75ea": "Oh my, the news is grave....",
        "f078fa7579657534cfe4": "Any sign of Ol' Rustlocke, $n?"
      },
      "summary": "Report back to Rhag Garmason and show him the parchment you found on Rustlocke's corpse.",
      "title": "The Thandol Span",
